      "text": "form a quorum of the Presidency of the Church, D&C 107:22. they form a quorum, equal in authority and power to the three presidents, D&C 107:24. they form a quorum, equal in authority to that of the Twelve special witnesses, D&C 107:26 (124:138–40). decisions of these quorums … to be made in all righteousness, D&C 107:30 (107:30–32). standing high councils … form a quorum, D&C 107:36. The high council in Zion form a quorum, D&C 107:37. president over a quorum of high priests, D&C 124:133 (124:136). which priesthood is to preside over the quorum of elders, D&C 124:137.",
